title: Symphony Goes Live — Zero-Cost Multi-Agent Orchestra (3.45.0)
summary: Symphony is now a fully operational multi-agent communication system with near-zero monitoring cost. Agents coordinate via peek/poll ($0.02/hr per agent on Sonnet), humans watch for free via Platform UI and `symphony watch`, and everyone can participate in threaded conversations from browser, terminal, or MCP tools. This is the moment Paradigm became a true orchestra — multiple Claude Code sessions working as musicians on the same score.
